+    `get_freeze_filter` only ever builds regexes over `.*llm.*`, and nothing in
+    the model puts LoRA in the vision tower, so a LoRA config leaves all ~415M
+    SigLIP parameters fully trainable. Measured: a pi05 LoRA config with both
+    variants set trains 0.467B parameters, of which 0.414B is the vision tower
